The package libsssp provides CMake targets:

  find_package(libsssp CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE libsssp::libsssp)

Alternatively, use pkg-config:

  pkg-config --cflags --libs libsssp

For shared library:
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE libsssp::shared)

For static library:
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE libsssp::static)
